    "Abgezogen wird pro Tag die Menge aus dem Einnahmeplan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deducts the scheduled daily amount."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abgezogen wird, was du in Apple Health als „genommen“ protokollierst." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deducts whatever you log as “taken” in Apple Health."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abgezogen wird, was du in Health als „genommen“ protokollierst. Die App liest nur und sieht nur die Medikamente, die du freigibst." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deducts whatever you log as “taken” in Health. The app only reads data and only sees the medications you share."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aktuell" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Current"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alle freigegebenen Medikamente sind schon in der Liste. Weitere gibst du in den Einstellungen frei." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All shared medications are already in your list. You can share more in Settings."
